cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "framesync: a CCSDS telemetry frame-level link performance harness"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/OmAcharya-avtr/framesync"
abstract: >-
  Frame-level link performance for CCSDS telemetry: attached sync marker
  correlation detection, the sync acquisition/flywheel/loss state machine
  with its transition thresholds, slip and false-sync behaviour, and frame
  error rate against Eb/N0 for an uncoded link, an RS(255,223) link and a
  rate-1/2 K=7 convolutionally coded link. A harness over existing codecs,
  not a codec and not a packet parser. Research-grade; not flight-qualified,
  not certified, not approved for operational aerospace use.
keywords:
  - CCSDS
  - telemetry
  - frame synchronisation
  - Reed-Solomon
  - Viterbi
  - frame error rate
